          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your kinetic gate is deactivated.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You open your kinetic gate, but rather than activating your kinetic aura, you instead become overwhelmed with transformative elemental energy. You're affected by an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Elemental Form] spell with the same trait as your kinetic element. You can heighten it to any spell rank up to half your level rounded up.</p>"
